          "ImageDescription": {
            "value": "<p>Hôtel Hérouet, Le Marais, Paris.\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin:.5em 0;overflow:hidden\">\n<table cellspacing=\"8\" cellpadding=\"0\" lang=\"en\" class=\"layouttemplate\" style=\"margin:0;width:100%;border:2px solid #999933;background:var(--background-color-success-subtle,#F9FFF0);direction:ltr;color:inherit;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:60px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Logo_monument_historique_-_rouge.svg/60px-Logo_monument_historique_-_rouge.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Logo_monument_historique_-_rouge.svg/120px-Logo_monument_historique_-_rouge.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"800\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"layouttemplateargs\" style=\"display:none;speak:none;\" title=\"template=M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e 1%3DPA00086138 2%3D 3%3D 3%3D 3%3D type%3Dclass%C3%A9\"> </span>\n<p>This building is <i>classé au titre des <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monument_historique\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Monument historique\">monuments historiques de la France</a></i>. It is indexed in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base_M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Base Mérimée\">base Mérimée</a>, a database of architectural heritage maintained by the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minister_of_Culture_(France)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Minister of Culture (France)\">French Ministry of Culture</a>, under the reference <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.pop.culture.gouv.fr/notice/merimee/PA00086138\">PA00086138</a> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/special:search?search=haswbstatement%3AP380%3DPA00086138\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Wikidata-logo.svg/20px-Wikidata-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Wikidata-logo.svg/40px-Wikidata-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1050\" data-file-height=\"590\"></a></span>.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:small;line-height:1.4\" class=\"plainlinks noprint\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e/br\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e/br\"><bdi class=\"language lang-br\" lang=\"br\">brezhoneg</bdi></a> <b>∙</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e/ca\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e/ca\"><bdi class=\"language lang-ca\" lang=\"ca\">català</bdi></a> <b>∙</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e/de\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e/de\"><bdi class=\"language lang-de\" lang=\"de\">Deutsch</bdi></a> <b>∙</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e/en\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e/en\"><bdi class=\"language lang-en\" lang=\"en\">English</bdi></a> <b>∙</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e/es\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e/es\"><bdi class=\"language lang-es\" lang=\"es\">español</bdi></a> <b>∙</b> <